## Key Design Decisions

- **Pre-chunked beats**: Script generator owns chunking (~10 words/beat). Beat generator only assigns types + metadata. This avoids LLM timing hallucinations.
- **WhisperX as ground truth**: All frame timing derived from forced alignment, not LLM estimates.
- **Two-mode beat generator**: Backward compatible with legacy full-chunking mode, but MODE A is the happy path.
- **Daily dedupe**: Prevents re-generating the same story in one day; resets at midnight.
- **Category-aware fetching**: AI / Business / Science sources interleaved to avoid rate limits and ensure diversity.
- **Engagement-aware scoring**: YouTube view counts, HN points, Reddit upvotes all normalized into heuristic score.

