## Common Issues & Fixes

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| "No stories found" | Check RSS feeds in `news_fetcher.py` — some may 404/block |
| LLM JSON parse error | `beat_generator.py` now handles both MODE A/B formats + markdown fences |
| Beat duration too long | Auto-splitter kicks in for splittable types > 3.7s |
| Frame gaps/overlaps | `auto_fix_frames` snaps each beat start to previous end |
| Groq TPM limit | Prompt truncated to 170 words / 6 sentences; `max_tokens=6000` |
| Reddit 429 | 8s delay + 3 retries built into `fetch_rss` |
| Google News redirects | Resolved for top candidates only (saves requests) |

